{
  "name": "@studio/song",
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "The song layer — parses a folder of CUE files and compiles it: to a flat ProjectDoc/GraphDoc for st0, and the same folder's picture to a VideoProjectDoc. A strudel lane compiles to the engine plugin that plays it (enginePattern.ts). Consumed as source.",
